  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 87ce85000b4c98049b54e2d6859899ae, type: 3}
  m_Name: TradeMaglevTerminal
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BuildingDefinition
  id: TradeMaglevTerminal
  displayName: Maglev Terminal
  description: 'A streamlined terminal of chrome and neon over a humming guideway.
    Runs maglev freighters on 3 routes where rail or guideway is laid along most
    of the way (wagon trains otherwise). Build one in each of two towns (a town has
    housing or a town centre) and a trade route opens between them; caravans then
    go to and fro, and every trip brings coin and goods: more for long routes between
    big towns, and more on roads. Outposts the route passes produce more. Raiders
    attack caravans on the road.'
